sh about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Using Modals to Express Preferences About Food", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could, would,</span> and  <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to express preferences about food.<br/>You ask questions with modals like <span class=\"italic\">Would you like to ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Should we ... ?</span><br/>You can use the short form of<span class=\"italic\"> would</span> in an answer, like <span class=\"italic\">I'd like to ...</span><br/>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Questions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Answers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you like to ... ? <br/>Should we ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, I'd like/love to ... <br/>No, I would prefer to ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you come?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes. I would like to.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Andrew</span>: Would you like to eat Thai food tonight?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Beth</span>: Yes! I'd love to try a new restaurant.<br/>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Andrew</span>: Should we make a reservation at Thai Basil? Could you meet me at 7?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Beth</span>: I don't feel like eating Thai. I would prefer to eat Japanese food.<br/>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to go out ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to leave the house", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to go out tonight. Let's eat at Thai Basil!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le01ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about going out for dinner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "downtown", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the center of the city", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many good places to eat downtown.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le01ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "how about ...", "type": "name"}, {"content": "what do you think about ...", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How about eating Thai tonight?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le01ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to feel like", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to want to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I really feel like eating Thai tonight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le01ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cheesecake", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in North America, a popular cake made with cream cheese", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is this new cheesecake place downtown. Let's go!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le01ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [